<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1969</h1><p class="ref-lede">1969 in world history: 21 events, 5 births, 29 deaths, 2 states founded and 5 that came to an end. 239 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
